  "details": "If a world instantiates audio sources, they will not be handled by VRChat's audio mixer and will always play.\n\nRepro:\n\n1. Visit world https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_33a47659-6286-461f-83a8-8925a6e04b12\n\n2. Mute Ingame Audio (Either World or Master, happens in both cases.)\n\n3. In the example world, press TAB (Or the left trigger twice) to spawn the control tablet.\n\n4. Its sounds will play even though they should not.\n\n1436 (Live) and 1444 (Open Beta)",
